# The microcode Firebrand.kext carries, by linux-firmware name. The Makefile
# embeds each file from ../../firmware (scripts/fetch-firmware.sh fills it;
# never committed) once, into the FirebrandFirmware personality's "Firmware"
# dictionary under its own name (a file with the same bytes as an earlier one
# becomes an alias of it, embed-firmware.pl), and LICENSE.amdgpu into
# Contents/Resources. The driver asks for files by name (frb_os.firmware), as
# amdgpu asks request_firmware; amdgpu/frb_fw_select.c makes amdgpu's choice
# of name, and tests/frb_fw_select_test.c checks that every name any matched
# card may ask for is listed here (make -C tests fwselect).
#
# Polaris 12, not a "kicker" part (ASICID_IS_P23 is 6987/6981 only):
# - MC: both images; gmc_v8_0_init_microcode picks one from MC_IO_DEBUG_UP_159.
# - SMC: polaris12_smc.bin.
# - CP: the _2 variants amdgpu loads when present (the captures loaded them).
# - RLC, SDMA0/1: through the SMU's table of contents.
# - UVD: the decoder's VCPU image, copied into VRAM by the driver (frb_uvd.c,
#   amdgpu_uvd_resume); polaris10_uvd.bin under Polaris 12's name. VCE stays out.
polaris12_mc.bin
polaris12_32_mc.bin
polaris12_smc.bin
polaris12_ce_2.bin
polaris12_me_2.bin
polaris12_pfp_2.bin
polaris12_mec_2.bin
polaris12_mec2_2.bin
polaris12_rlc.bin
polaris12_sdma.bin
polaris12_sdma1.bin
polaris12_uvd.bin
# Southern Islands, the R7 450 (Cape Verde): gmc_v6_0 picks si58 for its memory
# (MC_SEQ_MISC0[31:24] = 0x58), verde otherwise; si_dpm the kicker SMC image for
# 682b rev 87 (verde_k), verde otherwise.
verde_mc.bin
si58_mc.bin
verde_smc.bin
verde_k_smc.bin
# gfx_v6_0: the CP's three engines and the RLC, by amdgpu's names (headered;
# verde_ce.bin is linux-firmware's link to hainan_ce.bin). uvd_v3_1: the VCPU
# image (amdgpu_uvd.c FIRMWARE_VERDE). si_dma has no microcode.
verde_pfp.bin
verde_me.bin
verde_ce.bin
verde_rlc.bin
verde_uvd.bin
# Sea Islands, the FirePro W8100 (Hawaii): gmc_v7_0's MC image; the SMC image
# stage smu checks and CI DPM loads (hawaii_k_smc.bin is for rev 0x80 parts
# only, which no row names). The amdgpu and radeon files are the same bytes
# (RadeonNI loads radeon/hawaii_mc.bin and hawaii_smc.bin on this card).
hawaii_mc.bin
hawaii_smc.bin
# gfx_v7_0: the CP's three engines and the RLC, by amdgpu's names (headered).
# amdgpu's hawaii_pfp/me/ce are newer than radeon's (different bytes; RadeonNI
# loads radeon's, and its CP measurements on this card were made with them);
# hawaii_rlc.bin is the same file in both. hawaii_mec.bin stays out: no compute
# rings, the MEC is left halted. cik_sdma: both engines' images (linux-firmware's
# links to bonaire_sdma.bin / bonaire_sdma1.bin, the same bytes as radeon's).
hawaii_pfp.bin
hawaii_me.bin
hawaii_ce.bin
hawaii_rlc.bin
hawaii_sdma.bin
hawaii_sdma1.bin
# uvd_v4_2: the VCPU image (amdgpu_uvd.c FIRMWARE_HAWAII; radeon and RadeonNI
# load bonaire_uvd.bin on Hawaii, the same family 1.64)
hawaii_uvd.bin

# ---- Every other chip of the ported families (2026-11-15) ----------------------
# For untested cards: the files frb_fw_select.c asks for on these chips (Linux 7.1's
# MODULE_FIRMWARE names, linux-firmware 20260916). Carried, not run on hardware: no card
# of these chips has been in a machine here.
# Southern Islands: Tahiti, Pitcairn, Oland, Hainan. gmc_v6_0's MC images (si58_mc.bin is
# carried already), si_dpm_init_microcode's SMC images with the kickers (pitcairn_k,
# oland_k, hainan_k, banks_k_2 for Hainan 6665 rev c3), gfx_v6_0's CP and RLC images,
# UVD 3.1 (Hainan has none). Several are linux-firmware links to the same bytes; the
# kext keeps one copy of each (embed-firmware.pl's aliases).
banks_k_2_smc.bin
hainan_ce.bin
hainan_k_smc.bin
hainan_mc.bin
hainan_me.bin
hainan_pfp.bin
hainan_rlc.bin
hainan_smc.bin
oland_ce.bin
oland_k_smc.bin
oland_mc.bin
oland_me.bin
oland_pfp.bin
oland_rlc.bin
oland_smc.bin
oland_uvd.bin
pitcairn_ce.bin
pitcairn_k_smc.bin
pitcairn_mc.bin
pitcairn_me.bin
pitcairn_pfp.bin
pitcairn_rlc.bin
pitcairn_smc.bin
pitcairn_uvd.bin
tahiti_ce.bin
tahiti_mc.bin
tahiti_me.bin
tahiti_pfp.bin
tahiti_rlc.bin
tahiti_smc.bin
tahiti_uvd.bin
# Sea Islands: Bonaire's MC, SMC (and its kicker), CP, RLC, SDMA and UVD images, and
# Hawaii's kicker SMC image (rev 0x80).
bonaire_ce.bin
bonaire_k_smc.bin
bonaire_mc.bin
bonaire_me.bin
bonaire_pfp.bin
bonaire_rlc.bin
bonaire_sdma1.bin
bonaire_sdma.bin
bonaire_smc.bin
bonaire_uvd.bin
hawaii_k_smc.bin
# Polaris 10 and 11: gmc_v8_0's MC images (the _k ones for ASICID_IS_P30 / P21 / P31),
# amdgpu_cgs's SMC images (_k for P20 / P21, _k2 for P30 / P31, _smc_sk when the SMU
# takes the soft key), the SMU7 table of contents (the _2 CP images, RLC, SDMA) and UVD.
polaris10_ce_2.bin
polaris10_k2_smc.bin
polaris10_k_mc.bin
polaris10_k_smc.bin
polaris10_mc.bin
polaris10_me_2.bin
polaris10_mec2_2.bin
polaris10_mec_2.bin
polaris10_pfp_2.bin
polaris10_rlc.bin
polaris10_sdma1.bin
polaris10_sdma.bin
polaris10_smc.bin
polaris10_smc_sk.bin
polaris10_uvd.bin
polaris11_ce_2.bin
polaris11_k2_smc.bin
polaris11_k_mc.bin
polaris11_k_smc.bin
polaris11_mc.bin
polaris11_me_2.bin
polaris11_mec2_2.bin
polaris11_mec_2.bin
polaris11_pfp_2.bin
polaris11_rlc.bin
polaris11_sdma1.bin
polaris11_sdma.bin
polaris11_smc.bin
polaris11_smc_sk.bin
polaris11_uvd.bin
# Polaris 12 kicker parts (ASICID_IS_P23): their MC and SMC images.
polaris12_k_mc.bin
polaris12_k_smc.bin
# Vega M: no MC image; SMC, the table of contents (CP without _2, MEC2, RLC, SDMA), UVD.
vegam_ce.bin
vegam_me.bin
vegam_mec2.bin
vegam_mec.bin
vegam_pfp.bin
vegam_rlc.bin
vegam_sdma1.bin
vegam_sdma.bin
vegam_smc.bin
vegam_uvd.bin
